The development and commercialization of products for human gastrointestinal health is highly competitive, and our success depends on our ability to compete effectively with other products in the market. During the ongoing commercialization of Mytesi for its currently approved indication and during the future commercialization of Mytesi for any planned follow-on indications, if such follow-on indications receive regulatory approval, we expect to compete with major pharmaceutical and biotechnology companies that operate in the gastrointestinal space, such as Takeda Pharmaceuticals, Ironwood Pharmaceuticals, Inc., Synergy Pharmaceuticals Inc., and Sebela Pharmaceuticals, Inc.

